{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-relics","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigRelic-33155","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-relics-item-ItemConfigRelic-33155-item-ItemConfigRelic-33155-0","text":"位面封装的是青丘步离的穹窿金帐。与步离人留在银河中的蛮野名声不同，他们拥有非凡的生物技术。狼子们汇聚在伟大的巢父都蓝之侧，将天上众星视为牧畜，逐驰其间。","speaker":""}]}
